# Google Maps Platform (Places Autocomplete + Nearby)
# Create a key at https://console.cloud.google.com/ with:
#   - Maps JavaScript API
#   - Places API
# Restrict by HTTP referrer (localhost + your Vercel domain).
# Google gives monthly credit; production usage is billed after that.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Supabase (Project Settings → API)
# Use the Project URL and the anon public key only.
# Never put the service_role key in the frontend.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Paystack public key is optional for Inline JS (we use hosted checkout via Edge Function).
# Secret key must ONLY live in Supabase Edge Function secrets as PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY.
# VITE_PAYSTACK_PUBLIC_KEY=
